   {
    "ja": "暗号解読士 九條キリヤの事件簿"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Case Files of the Codebreaker Kiriya Kujo"
   },
   {
    "en": "Codebreaker Kiriya Kujo's Casebook"
   }
